### Emission Sources Management (Exhaustive Inventory)
#### [NEW] [Backend]
- Create `emission_sources` table with comprehensive attributes:
    - [id](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/server.js#374-398) (PK)
    - `facility_id` (FK)
    - `name` (Text)
    - `type` (Text: Combustion, Flaring, Venting, Fugitive, Mobile, Electricity)
    - `fuel_type` (Text: e.g. Natural Gas, Diesel - Optional)
    - `design_capacity` (Text: e.g. 10 MMBtu/hr - Optional)
    - `installation_date` (Date - Optional)
    - `status` (Text: Active, Standby, Retired - Default Active)
    - `description` (Text)
    - `created_at`
- Add endpoints: `GET/POST/DELETE /api/sources`.

